  "content": {
    "id": "p27-q9-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "In a recent election, 75 votes were cast. Jo received twice as many votes as Tracy. Penny had 9 more than Sue and 6 more than Tracy. Penny had ten times as many votes as Alice. How many votes did each candidate receive?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": {
        "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "p27-q9-short-result",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Jo: 28 votes; Tracy: 14 votes; Penny: 20 votes; Sue: 11 votes; Alice: 2 votes.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p27-q9-short-method",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Express each share in terms of Penny’s votes and set their sum equal to 75.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "Let $p$ be Penny’s number of votes. Tracy received $p-6$, Jo received $2(p-6)$, Sue received $p-9$, and Alice received $\\frac{p}{10}$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2(p-6)+(p-6)+p+(p-9)+\\frac{p}{10}&=75\\\\5p-27+\\frac{p}{10}&=75\\\\50p-270+p&=750\\\\51p&=1020\\\\p&=20\\end{align*}$$\n\nHence Tracy received $20-6=14$ votes, Jo received $2(14)=28$ votes, Sue received $20-9=11$ votes, and Alice received $20\\div10=2$ votes. Penny received 20 votes.\n\nCheck: $28+14+20+11+2=75$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 88
  },
